This product includes software developed by Traefik Labs.

`src/script.rs` embeds, verbatim, the Lua token-bucket script published in
Traefik Proxy at `pkg/middlewares/ratelimiter/lua.go`. The copies exist to be
compared against what a caller sends, so that a change to the upstream algorithm
is detected rather than silently served with stale semantics. They are never
executed by this program.

Two revisions are embedded, because the text changed between releases while the
algorithm did not:

  - PINNED_SCRIPT               as published in Traefik v3.7.1
  - PINNED_SCRIPT_SPACED_RETURN as published later on the Traefik v3.7 branch

